{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id1354529456"}, "name":{"label":"nicswieweg"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-11-12T08:39:39-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.9.5"}, "id":{"label":"11942193233"}, "title":{"label":"Good app but I switched to another anyway"}, "content":{"label":"The app does what it is supposed to do very well and it is great that it is very minimalistic. My issue with it was the price. 35€ for lifetime access for (essentially) an automated excel sheet was just too much, considering that I used to be able to buy PlayStation and Nintendo games for less. I found a great habit tracker app for 6.99€ (lifetime) which has more functions. I would have stuck with HabitKit if the price wasn’t as high.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
