{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id339706922"}, "name":{"label":"Elias-the-European"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-14T06:35:25-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.9.2"}, "id":{"label":"11833079994"}, "title":{"label":"My All-Time Favourite"}, "content":{"label":"Clear structure. All necessary functions. And unbeatable design.\nNo other app can keep up with that!\nI love the unique approach of displaying the calendar as dots.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id184057449"}, "name":{"label":"Applemansker"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-10T08:31:22-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.9.2"}, "id":{"label":"11818567731"}, "title":{"label":"I like it, but no icloud sync, no native ipad adaptation"}, "content":{"label":"I like the style of the app and the really excellent handling of the entries. These were the deciding factors for me to spend the 35 euros on the Pro version. Unfortunately, I only realised afterwards that there is no iCloud sync with the iPad and that the iPad App does not adapt to the bigger display. The iPhone view on the iPad is not very nice. \nIf the Pro version cost €5 or even €10, I would still be happy with it. But for 35 euros I would like to have the synchronisation and the adaptation to the iPad.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id1336504122"}, "name":{"label":"MrYearh"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-09-29T01:48:57-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.9.1"}, "id":{"label":"11777039590"}, "title":{"label":"(Almost) perfect"}, "content":{"label":"Good features including home-screen widget, only feature I would hope to see in the future is a lock-screen widget", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id290003488"}, "name":{"label":"WeristMaris"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-09-25T00:47:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.9.1"}, "id":{"label":"11762071060"}, "title":{"label":"Very cool App"}, "content":{"label":"I've tried out a lot of different Habit Tracker Apps and for me this ones the best so far. I used it for a year now and like how minimalistic it is and especially that you can have an overview of all your habits for the last year oder so in one overview and i like that you can turn of the streaks for individual habits. That way I can track bad habits without being rewarded for doing them times in a row 😅. The only feature I would like to have is a note feature so that you can take notes on how you achieved something or while mood tracking, why you had a good/bad day.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id1617582888"}, "name":{"label":"Simon472728"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-09-16T11:34:05-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.8.4"}, "id":{"label":"11731305288"}, "title":{"label":"What else would you want?"}, "content":{"label":"Clean and useful. Great job, true craftsmanship! And fair price.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id966396700"}, "name":{"label":"vimexe"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-08-09T23:44:56-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.8.3"}, "id":{"label":"11592828336"}, "title":{"label":"Wunderbar!"}, "content":{"label":"Sehr guter Habit-Tracker. Minimalistisch, aber trotzdem viele Funktionen. Habe viele Apps getestet, aber der gefällt mir am besten.\n\nEs kommen auch regelmäßig gute Updates. Kleine Anekdote: Ich hatte eigentlich vor, einen Feature-Wunsch für eine kompaktere Ansicht einzureichen, hat sich einen Tag später aber von selbst erledigt, weil das passende Update schon ausgerollt wurde 😄. Gerne weiter so!\n\nEin kleiner Wunsch wäre noch, dass man beim »Teilen« (Bildexport) auch nur die letzte Woche und den letzten Monat exportieren kann.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id38908104"}, "name":{"label":"railboi"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-07-30T02:00:05-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.8.2"}, "id":{"label":"11551214646"}, "title":{"label":"Beste App für die Etablierung von Habits"}, "content":{"label":"Ich hab schon einige Apps für das Habit-Tracking ausprobiert, aber HabitKit gefällt mir bei weitem am Besten. Das UI, der Minimalismus der App und die farbenfrohe Darstellung gefällt mir mega gut.\n\nAußerdem ist der Entwickler einer super netter Dude, der einem bei Problemen schnell hilft. Ich hatte einen Bug in den Widgets gemeldet und zwei Tage später gab es einen Fix. Klasse!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id1623553865"}, "name":{"label":"haselnuss22"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-07-20T05:06:16-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.8.0"}, "id":{"label":"11514281951"}, "title":{"label":"Bester Habit Tracker"}, "content":{"label":"Ich habe (viel zu) viele Habit Tracker ausprobiert. Die einen haben kein Widget, die anderen sind nicht intuivitiv, haben zu viele Funktionen oder eine völlig überteuerte Premiumversion. HabitKit ist perfekt und hat einen fairen Preis, wenn man auf die Vollversion zugreifen möchte. Das neueste Update mit den kompakteren Ansichten ist sehr gelungen und zeigt, dass der Entwickler weiter an dem Produkt arbeitet. Wenn die kompakte Übersicht jetzt auch noch in die Widgets einfließen würde, sodass ich in einem Widgets mehrere Gewohnheiten sehen kann, bin ich wunschlos glücklich.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id11138095"}, "name":{"label":"UraharaK"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-07-04T04:12:36-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.7.3"}, "id":{"label":"11455084509"}, "title":{"label":"I really love the app"}, "content":{"label":"Love the functionality, ease of use and optics (especially for progress overview). Feels great to set a habit done. I tried around 10 other apps. Some are better in some way or another. But as overall package the HabitKit works great for me.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id175181157"}, "name":{"label":"Privatgebrauch"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-06-28T16:47:59-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.7.3"}, "id":{"label":"11434680073"}, "title":{"label":"Best habit tracker I tested"}, "content":{"label":"Since the update the widget works as it should and that makes this the best habit tracker I found.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id42848049"}, "name":{"label":"vachmann"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-06-17T02:52:53-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.7.2"}, "id":{"label":"11390805675"}, "title":{"label":"Great design and user experience"}, "content":{"label":"I love the github-like grid view of your habit completions. The whole app is designed really well!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id588743825"}, "name":{"label":"Maivia.lin"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-05-16T13:26:12-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.8"}, "id":{"label":"11274553518"}, "title":{"label":"Nicht nur zum Habit Tracking"}, "content":{"label":"Ich find die App großartig. Sie ist simple und minimalistisch. Ich Tracke nicht nur Gewohnheiten, sondern auch andere Dinge, die ich im Überblick halten möchte.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id316143592"}, "name":{"label":"chromatischecaro"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-05-10T01:26:35-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.8"}, "id":{"label":"11251408776"}, "title":{"label":"Sehr gute App"}, "content":{"label":"Ich finde die App sehr toll und nutze sie jeden Tag. Eine coole Idee wäre noch, dass man jeden Tag angeben kann, wie oft man was gemacht hat und dass die Farbe dann etwas dunkler erscheint je öfter es gemacht wurde. Also wenn ich z.B. angebe ich mache eine bestimmte Task 1 mal am Tag, habe sie aber 3 mal gemacht, dass man das dann auch sehen kann.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id323337918"}, "name":{"label":"Emsa99"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-03-24T14:35:06-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.8"}, "id":{"label":"11081763094"}, "title":{"label":"Simpel und gut"}, "content":{"label":"Sehr gute App für einen den Aufbau von Gewohnheiten. Sehr einfach zu bedienen und schönes, simples Design. \n\nIch könnte mir noch eine Art „grouping“ Funktion vorstellen, da wenn man mehrere Gewohnheiten eingibt, verliert man irgendwann den Überblick.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id1002021441"}, "name":{"label":"Apocye"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-03-20T03:09:49-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.8"}, "id":{"label":"11064715825"}, "title":{"label":"Übersichtliche, produktive App!"}, "content":{"label":"Ich bin überraschend erfreut über diese App. Sie ist übersichtlich, sehr einfach zu bedienen und hat erstaunlich viele Einstellungsmöglichkeiten. Top!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id1556080394"}, "name":{"label":"Biskit1943"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-03-02T04:05:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.8"}, "id":{"label":"10999561003"}, "title":{"label":"Best visual app so far"}, "content":{"label":"I tried several apps and this one is the most appealing for me.\n\nOne thing I’m missing ist the possibility to silence a reminder when I’ve done my task already. For example if my plan is to do something once per week I would expect my reminder to be silent for the rest of the week once I’ve marked it as completed.\n\nIt would also be nice if the visual tracker would scale with the number of occurrences. I’d like to have just one block per week if my occurrence ist just once per week, etc…", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id86217036"}, "name":{"label":"Kitty45678767"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-02-16T04:38:05-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.8"}, "id":{"label":"10944841088"}, "title":{"label":"Beste und übersichtlichster Habittracker"}, "content":{"label":"Ich habe schon vieler der Habittracker getestet, dieser ist wirklich am besten. Wenn in Zukunft noch die angekündigte Funktion kommt das abgehakte Habits ausgeblendet werden können. Dann ist sie perfekt ;)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id628620935"}, "name":{"label":"Marlonnn.k"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-01-21T00:18:46-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.8"}, "id":{"label":"10846407332"}, "title":{"label":"Most simple and best habit-tracker."}, "content":{"label":"I love this app. It is very simple. There are no crazy, useless extra features, that nobody needs (like on other apps); that’s why I got this one.\n\nThe developer is also responsive to feedback and ideas.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
