{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id1336662215"}, "name":{"label":"Ufa.ha"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-10-24T01:58:45-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.5.9"}, "id":{"label":"10509659845"}, "title":{"label":"I love it but would be great if"}, "content":{"label":"I love the app, I think it’s really great, it helps a lot track my habits and remind me to keep them in mind, I have a few comments about the usability though, I would prefer that it’s easier to see the habits I haven’t checked yet, like an automatic reordering, once you check off the ones you achieved for the day, the ones that are still not done will be reordered to be on top. Doesn’t matter how but it would be great when I open the app to have a summary of what I did and what is left to be done for the day. \nThank you", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id121720848"}, "name":{"label":"Ventes"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-09-23T02:29:40-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.5.9"}, "id":{"label":"10397897314"}, "title":{"label":"Verwende ich täglich"}, "content":{"label":"Was bedeutet, dass sie funktioniert! Motiviert mich immer, dass ich an meinen Gewohnheiten festhalte. Sehr intuitiv und optisch sehr ansprechend!! Hatte noch nicht einen Crash oder anderen bug. Mit der App passt einfach alles 😍", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
