{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id1188914775"}, "name":{"label":"julyyyde"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-08-15T05:00:38-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.5.8"}, "id":{"label":"10260406195"}, "title":{"label":"Simply the best!"}, "content":{"label":"I tried so so many habit trackers but they are either complicated with too many functions and just too all over the place. They also don’t really motivate you enough to keep going. This app shows your progress right under the habit. The progress for many months!!! not just for the current week. This way, you don’t feel discouraged if you have been off track for one entire week or maybe longer. This amazing design of the app promotes a healthy mindset which I just love. I bought the lifetime subscription. It is just worth it and I am happy to support the app developer. Much respect!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
